Offering register:

The 福德 plaque, if confirmed, is not strictly an ICON but indexes Tudi Gong / Fude Zhengshen as a referenced — not iconographically present — administrative deity. RFIG-wise, this is closer to a complex-scope relation (toponymic/textual reference to a deity housed elsewhere) than an altar-scope relation.

